  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A one-page dashboard for checking a Dual-View CNN's performance on Kepler transit candidates. It ranks the candidates by a scientific priority score, lets you search, sort and export them, and shows any single candidate's prediction, a plain-language explanation and its global and local light curves. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
